commit 2b63e0dd
author: cdvankammen
date: 2026-10-23 19:38:21 -0600
subject: fix(rebase): restore ~40 lost test regressions after rebase onto master

- kiro translator: systemPrompt exposed on payload (27 tests)
- security-audit: CWD-relative paths + byApiKey expectation (13 tests)
- shutdown route: full CLI token + JWT auth from backup (13 tests)
- conversation-keyset: migration registry 001-005 restored, requestStats in schema.js (12 tests)
- golden snapshots regenerated (140 tests)
- iflow/cloudflare/vercel/audio-voices routes: AbortSignal.timeout restored
- project-id-backoff + onboard-behavior: exponential backoff restored (11 tests)
- opencode-free-tool-choice: mock applyFingerprintTools (master addition)
- db-sqlite-vs-lowdb: unregistered FK migration (production dropped it)
- default-executor: supportsIncludeUsage + stream_options injection (8 tests)
- mcp-auth: CLI token gate on sse + message routes (4 tests)
- cowork-skip-approvals: exported writeSkipApprovals with structured error (4 tests)
- models-card: useNotificationStore restored (5 tests)
- image-generation: use live CODEX_CLI_VERSION (21 tests)
- force-stream-config: added missing headroom mock exports
- combo-autoswitch: web_search detection + identity return (2 tests)
- windsurf: uncommented registry, fixed baseUrl to self-serve
- version-update-auth: CLI token + dashboard auth restored (2 tests)
- auth-login-setup-gate: setupRequired state gate restored (2 tests)
- kiro executor: defensive null check on event.headers access

Suite: 3515 passed | 65 failed | 51 regressions (down from 269/246 at start)
Goal: 94c822ed-4ce7-4282-ac16-92767d8f19be


